WEBVTT

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.020
Your leg or your head...

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:47.670
Which do you prefer first?

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:54.990
<i>A large insect from Indonesia and from the 
superfamily Stenopelmatoidea, the Sia Ferox.</i>

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.620
<i>Diet: Carnivorous.</i>

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:00.110
<i>Legs: Strong.</i>

00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:02.620
<i>Disposition: Extremely ferocious.</i>

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:46.740
<i>Why am I remembering that...</i>

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:57.780
<b><i>A Single Drop From 
a Thunderstorm</i></b>

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:57.370
<i>at a time like this?</i>

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:18.540
<i>Shut up.</i>

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.660
<i>It already happened.</i>

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.580
<i>It should be over already.</i>

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:42.380
<i>It doesn't disappear.</i>

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:45.720
<i>The sadness...</i>

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:49.010
<i>The nightmares...</i>

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:56.600
<i>It doesn't disappear.</i>

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:44.320
<i>The weakness of falling in love...</i>

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.990
<i>It's not as simple as that.</i>

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.790
<i>She made me human.</i>

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:57.100
<i>Say...</i>

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:59.170
<i>I...</i>

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:01.460
<i>I...</i>

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:04.950
<i>I wanted to be like you.</i>

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:07.040
<i>A human.</i>

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.510
<i>That's what I wanted to be... So...</i>

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:15.700
<i>So... why?</i>

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:22.980
<i>Why did you do something so animalistic?</i>

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:49.140
Division Leader...

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.310
What's wrong?

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.390
What's wrong?

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:04.170
More...

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.660
Come at me more.

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:12.110
I'll kill you.

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:54.670
A flag...?

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:22.580
Division Leader.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.020
Division Leader!

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.570
Division Leader, it's time to trade.

00:09:43.570 --> 00:09:45.300
Oh, right.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:52.340
Akari, you, too.

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:54.760
Wait, I can hold out a little more...

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:58.360
Though the procedure has 
made our bodies stronger,

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:01.780
it doesn't mean we can fight 
without sleep for forty days.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:04.870
Sleeping when you can is 
also part of the mission.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.460
Just shut up and let them trade with you.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:07.980
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:11.100
Alex, please.

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:13.370
Yeah, sure thing.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:17.520
<i>I understand how he feels 
so much that it hurts.</i>

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:26.140
<i>This ominous silence...</i>

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:30.150
<i>Something is happening.</i>

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:35.000
<i>My life... consisted of 
me just being used.</i>

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.790
<i>Eva... Isabella...</i>

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:42.450
<i>Everyone, I'm sorry.</i>

00:11:43.740 --> 00:11:45.640
<i>I'm finished.</i>

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:48.210
<i>I'm going to...</i>

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:04.810
Division Leader!

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.550
It'll work!

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:47.050
Eva! Hurry and get the division leader 
to the No. 4 Division's escape vessel.

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:47.940
Right!

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:51.080
Hurry! We'll hold things off here—

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:55.910
Even if it costs us our lives...

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:00.040
<i>Always...</i>

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:02.550
<i>Division Leader Adolf was always saving us.</i>

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:06.940
<i>Stop.</i>

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:23.610
<i>We're just useless trash on 
Earth and on Mars, but...</i>

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:30.240
<i>That's not true.</i>

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:32.750
<i>All of you... run...</i>

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:36.480
<i>I... I'm already...</i>

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:54.060
If we were to forget about

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:56.180
Adolf-san here, and run...

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:59.960
We really would be trash!

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:36.990
Eva!

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:38.430
Make sure you...

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:41.560
With the Division Leader... please.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:45.230
The vaccine... Save my son!

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.540
Division Leader?

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:58.500
No! He's cold! His heart is...

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:03.440
No, Division Leader. No!

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:17.210
Do you like animals?

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:18.970
Especially fish?

00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:22.650
I mean, you usually wouldn't 
know about that stuff.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:25.110
Like how the electricity 
in electric eels work.

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:31.530
Well... I didn't really want to be like this.

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:33.610
And it was just an experiment.

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:40.910
But all these things that've gotten 
involved with my life...

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.010
I love

00:15:55.190 --> 00:15:56.470
them.

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:21.370
<i>AED.</i>

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:23.620
<i>The automated external defibrillator.</i>

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:29.520
<i>Its function is to stop
 the ventricular fibrillation of the heart.</i>

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:34.100
<i>Once a person's heart 
has completely stopped,</i>

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:35.260
<i>their soul...</i>

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:37.190
<i>How frustrating.</i>

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:41.620
<i>As long as they still 
have the will to live...</i>

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:37.870
It's frustrating...

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:42.370
It's frustrating, isn't it, everyone?

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:47.620
Eva, Uaku, Henrique,

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:52.150
Sandra, Fritz, Antonio,

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:56.840
Rachel, Mirapix, Johann...

00:17:57.620 --> 00:17:58.760
Wait for me.

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.510
I'll save you!

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:12.910
The medicine... That amount...!

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:26.290
<i>Then the Lord said to Moses,</i>

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:31.710
<i>"Stretch out your hand toward the sky...</i>

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:37.140
Division Leader, no!

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:39.590
<i>...so that</i>

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:43.540
<i>hail will fall all over Egypt—</i>

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:47.480
<i>on people and animals</i>

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:55.990
<i>and on everything growing in the fields of Egypt."</i>

00:18:57.760 --> 00:19:02.820
<i>When Moses stretched out 
his staff toward the sky,</i>

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:10.310
<i>the Lord sent thunder and hail,</i>

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:14.740
<i>and lightning flashed down to the ground.</i>

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:20.250
<i>So the Lord rained hail on the land of Egypt;</i>

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:22.260
This is... 
his rage and sadness

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:32.270
<i>hail fell and lightning flashed back and forth.</i>

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:34.900
This is... Adolf Reinhardt

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.650
This is... 2nd

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:54.870
Move away... from there.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:58.630
<b>2nd</b>

00:19:58.650 --> 00:19:59.510
<b>M.A.R.S. Ranking 2nd</b>

00:19:58.650 --> 00:19:59.510
<b>Adolf Reinhardt</b>

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:00.510
<b>M.A.R.S. Ranking 2nd</b>

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:00.510
<b>Adolf Reinhardt</b>

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:01.880
<b>M.A.R.S. Ranking 2nd</b>

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:01.880
<b>Adolf Reinhardt</b>

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:03.640
<b>Adolf Reinhardt</b>

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:03.640
<b>M.A.R.S. Ranking 2nd</b>

00:20:08.300 --> 00:20:14.100
<i>It was the worst storm in all the land of Egypt</i>

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:20.360
<i>since it had become a nation.</i>

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:31.760
<i>This was how immense the Lord's power was.</i>

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:40.600
<i>The hail and thunder fell for 
many days and many nights</i>

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:47.760
<i>upon the city, mountains,
and forests of Egypt.</i>

00:20:55.600 --> 00:21:04.650
<i>Throughout Egypt hail struck everything 
in the fields—both people and animals;</i>

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:13.280
<i>it beat down everything</i>

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:22.400
<i>growing in the fields and stripped every tree.</i>
